ai/environment.md

# Bundled native tools. The binaries under native/ are the build inputs and are
# committed. A working copy is made at the top of native/uptooda/ so the tool
# can be run from the repo, because it looks for Data/ in its own directory.
native/uptooda/uptooda-cli
native/uptooda/uptooda-cli.exe

